flowchart TD
  A["Venus QuickJS：提交话题或群聊创建表单"] --> B["读取 `message.topic-list`、`message.channel-summary`、`message.left-dialog-list`、`message.member-roster` 完整 VM"]
  B --> C["Frame 内 `ActionBinding(make_topic/create_channel)`"]
  C --> D["native 注入 actor/requestId/observedRevision/surfaceEpoch"]
  D --> E["ActionInvocationEnvelope / HostObservation / Inbound"]
  E --> F["MobileImSdk -> CoreBridge -> helix-driver-ffi"]
  F --> G["`Tick::Command/Inbound/PortReply/Timer`"]
  G --> H["`http_write`、`storage_upsert`、`projection`"]
  H --> I["Go authority：`POST /api/cses/channel/create` body `{type,userIds,displayName,forceCreate}`；session 身份、team、成员角色与默认 `pictureType=USER/picture.userIds` 由服务端派生，客户端不得提交 team/role/owner/picture"]
  I --> J["WS/PortReply：`channel_created`"]
  J --> K["`PersistAtomic -> PersistOk`；SQLite `channel`、`channel_member`"]
  K --> L{"PersistOk?"}
  L -- "否" --> X["保留旧 VM；ActionReceipt failed；可重试"]
  L -- "是" --> M["SurfaceComposer：`message.topic-list`、`message.channel-summary`、`message.left-dialog-list`、`message.member-roster`"]
  M --> N["InteractionFrameV2 schemaVersion=2"]
  N --> O["FFI batch -> C++ SurfaceRuntime 整帧校验"]
  O --> P{"epoch/revision/causation 合法?"}
  P -- "否" --> Y["保留最后一致 VM；请求 snapshot/resync"]
  P -- "是" --> Q["原子提交 TopicListVm + ChannelSummaryVm + DialogListVm + MemberRosterVm"]
  Q --> R["QuickJS im.surface.view/pending"]
  R --> S["移动 UI：新群聊在首批四个 Surface 原子出现，成员与 viewer 隔离由权威事实决定"]
  S --> T["FrameApplied / directive ack / action terminal"]
